cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "age-rt-smoother: age-structured SEIR particle smoother for instantaneous reproduction numbers"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Minsoo
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Jong-Hoon
  - family-names: Son
    given-names: Woo-Sik
    email: woosik.son@gmail.com
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/woosikson/age-rt-smoother"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for an age-structured SEIR model combined with a fixed-window
  particle smoother that estimates age-specific instantaneous reproduction numbers
  from daily influenza case counts. Reproduces every figure and numeric table of the
  accompanying paper from raw inputs.
keywords:
  - reproduction number
  - particle smoother
  - sequential Monte Carlo
  - influenza
  - age-structured model
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "An Age-Structured Mathematical Modeling with Particle Smoother for Instantaneous Reproduction Number Estimation in Influenza Epidemics"
